      "text": "ACHILLES.\nI do disdain thy courtesy, proud Trojan.\nBe happy that my arms are out of use;\nMy rest and negligence befriend thee now,\nBut thou anon shalt hear of me again;\nTill when, go seek thy fortune.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
